<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>

  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="800" id="table652">
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <p align="center"><i><font size="7" color="#FF0000">The Skydog 
		Report</font></i></p>
		<p align="center">
		<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFFF00">Monday April 11, 
		2016</font><font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFCC99"> </font>
		<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFCC66"> and I am off to 
		barefoot with brother Gavin again. Back at the Ranch by 1 pm and there 
		are at least twenty gliders set up and by 2:30 a line is forming so I 
		get out there seventh in line. The first pilots to take off appear to be 
		doing well and up to four grand or so. When I finally get off of tow I 
		don't hear a beep and land </font>
		<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FF0000"> 17 minutes</font><font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFCC66"> 
		while some other are still high so I go again and this time the sky is 
		90% cloud covered and I have a </font>
		<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FF0000"> 14 minute</font><font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFCC66"> 
		bomb out. OK so now it is after 4:30 and lunch is over so I go again and 
		now the sky is looking good but I again don't get a beep and land after </font>
		<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FF0000"> 17 minutes</font><font face="Monotype Corsiva" size="5" color="#FFCC66">. 
		I see four gliders high in the sky and wonder hat I am doing wrong. 
		Maybe I should have turned the sound on so that I could hear it. (Only 
		Kidding) So now it is 6:30 and Jimmy is landing after a real nice 2-1/2 
		hour flight up to 4,625 feet ato. I am bummed with my performance and 
		hope to shape up Tuesday.</font></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p align="center"><b><i><font size="5">Pics Below</font></i></b></p>

<div align="center">
  <center>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" width="400" id="table864">
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <div align="center">
        <center>
        <table border="6" cellspacing="4" width="100%" bordercolorlight="#66CCFF" bordercolordark="#FFFF00" id="table865">
          <tr>
            <td width="100%">
            <p align="center">
            <img border="0" src="2016-DemoDays/11th/Snapshot-8-(12-04-2016-8-24-AM).jpg" width="800" height="600"></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        </center>
      </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
